## 3. Key Conversations – Hội thoại giao tiếp

![Chia sẻ sở thích — cách kết nối tự nhiên nhất](https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571019613454-1cb2f99b2d8b?w=700&q=80)

### Conversation A: Lần đầu nói chuyện về sở thích

> **A:** So, what do you like doing in your free time?
> **B:** I love reading and watching documentaries. What about you?
> **A:** I enjoy cooking! I try new recipes every weekend.
> **B:** That's cool! Do you ever bake?
> **A:** Sometimes. But honestly, I'm not very good at it. Ha!
> **B:** Neither am I. Maybe we should take a baking class together!

---

### Conversation B: Hỏi về thể thao

> **A:** Do you play any sports?
> **B:** Yes! I play badminton twice a week. Do you?
> **A:** I go to the gym, but I don't play team sports. I'm not very competitive.
> **B:** Really? I love the team spirit! How often do you go to the gym?
> **A:** Usually three times a week. Sometimes four if I have energy.
> **B:** Impressive! I should go more often. I only go once a week now.

---

### Conversation C: Cuối tuần lý tưởng

> **A:** What's your ideal weekend?
> **B:** Oh, I love lazy weekends — reading, watching series, ordering food in.
> **A:** Ha, I'm the opposite! I hate staying home. I always want to go somewhere.
> **B:** Like where?
> **A:** Hiking, exploring new cafes, taking photos. I enjoy being outdoors.
> **B:** That sounds exhausting to me, but it looks amazing on Instagram!

