## 5. Speaking Strategies – Chiến lược giao tiếp

### Hỏi về sở thích:

```
What do you like doing in your free time?
Do you have any hobbies?
Are you into [activity]?
Have you ever tried [activity]?
```

### Chia sẻ sở thích của mình:

```
I'm really into...
I'm passionate about...
I can't live without...
I spend a lot of time...
```

### Phản hồi khi có cùng sở thích:

```
Me too! / Same here!
Oh really? I love that too!
No way! I do that as well!
```

### Phản hồi khi có sở thích khác:

```
That's interesting! I've never tried that.
I'm not really into that, but I'd love to try sometime.
I prefer [alternative], but I can see why people like it.
```

> 💡 **Tip:** Đừng chỉ nói *"I like it"* — hãy giải thích WHY để cuộc trò chuyện thú vị hơn:
> *"I love hiking **because** it clears my mind and the views are amazing."*

